AbstractumVPN
=============

AbstractumVPN is a VPN client derived from AmneziaVPN.

    Upstream:  https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amnezia-client
    Forked at: e38a2339 (2026-07-31)

This is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by Amnezia. Please report issues with AbstractumVPN to this
repository, not to the upstream project.


